<p id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p">The upper limits on the SB production cross sections as functions of the SB mass are set for different <math id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\text{S}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\text{S}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{\text{S}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{\text{S}}</annotation></semantics></math> values. An example for <math id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\text{S}}=3.5\TeV" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>3.5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="undefined">\TeV</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\text{S}}=3.5\TeV</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{\text{S}}=0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{\text{S}}=0.2</annotation></semantics></math> is shown in Fig. <a href="#Ch0.F11" title='Figure 11 ‣ 0.9.2 Model-dependent results ‣ 0.9 Results ‣ A search for microscopic black holes, string balls, and sphalerons in proton-proton collisions at √𝑠=13⁢"ERROR \TeV"' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> (left). The excluded masses of the SB as functions of <math id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\text{S}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\text{S}}</annotation></semantics></math> at different <math id="Ch0.S9.SS2.p8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{\text{S}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{\text{S}}</annotation></semantics></math> values are summarized in Fig. <a href="#Ch0.F11" title='Figure 11 ‣ 0.9.2 Model-dependent results ‣ 0.9 Results ‣ A search for microscopic black holes, string balls, and sphalerons in proton-proton collisions at √𝑠=13⁢"ERROR \TeV"' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> (right).</p>
</div>
